# 🎓 Campus Genie

## AI-Powered College Admission & Internship Assistant

Campus Genie is an AI chatbot that helps students get information about:

- College admission
- Eligibility
- Required documents
- Internships
- Internship skills
- Interview preparation

The project uses **RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)** to retrieve relevant FAQs and generate answers using a local **Llama 3.2 3B** model.

## Features

- 🤖 AI-powered chatbot
- 🔍 FAQ semantic search
- ⚡ FAISS vector database
- 🧠 Sentence Transformers
- 🦙 Llama 3.2 3B
- 🚀 FastAPI backend
- 💻 HTML, CSS and JavaScript frontend
- 🌙 Dark-themed interface

## Technologies Used

- Python
- FastAPI
- Sentence Transformers
- FAISS
- Ollama
- Llama 3.2 3B
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

